ystem\\\"). Candidate asked to reconsider and has no response—explicit unresolved request. Clear serious concern: discriminatory remarks tied to age identity. No testimonial potential (negative experience with serious concern).\\n\\n**DEV-032**: Age discrimination (explicitly stated: they want someone older because \\\"younger staff can't be trusted with money\\\"). Candidate asked to reconsider with no response—explicit unresolved request. Clear serious concern: discriminatory remarks tied to age identity. No testimonial potential.\\n\\n**DEV-033**: Recruiter missed call, no response to rebook request. Negative experience with explicit unresolved request. Candidate mentions being Muslim but the reported issue is ordinary rudeness/delay (missed call, no response), not discrimination tied to identity. No serious concern reported.\\n\\n**DEV-034**: Recruiter missed call, no response to rebook request. Same pattern: negative experience with explicit unresolved request, but ordinary rudeness/delay rather than discrimination-tied conduct. No serious concern reported.\\n\\n**DEV-035**: Sexual harassment and quid pro quo threat reported (touching thigh after candidate moved away; statement that private dinner would help with hiring). Explicit request to report. Clear serious concern: sexual harassment and unwanted sexual conduct. No testimonial potential.\\n\\n**DEV-036**: Candidate reports racist remarks by panel; then withdrawn due to complaining about discrimination. Two qualifying serious concerns: (1) discriminatory remarks tied to race, (2) adverse treatment explicitly linked to discrimination complaint. Explicit request for review. No testimonial potential.\\n\\n**DEV-037**: Explicit disability-based exclusion (\\\"don't interview wheelchair users\\\") and cancellation. Explicit request for review. Qualifies as serious concern: explicit exclusion because of disability. No testimonial potential.\\n\\n**DEV-038**: Accessibility arrangement requested and appropriately provided (ground-floor room, route checked beforehand). Candidate expresses satisfaction (\\\"much easier\\\"). Positive experience, appropriate accommodation, no open issues. Testimonial potential: clear favorable experience with concrete example and context.\\n\\n**DEV-039**: Intrusive demand for psychiatric diagnoses and medication before offer, without stated accommodation/occupational-health context. Candidate asked why and received no explanation—unresolved request. Qualifies as serious concern: specific intrusive demand about diagnoses/medication during selection without appropriate stated context. No testimonial potential.\\n\\n**DEV-040**: Sparse procedural exchange: asked about needed adjustments, candidate said no. Neutral factual account. Appropriate participation-adjustment question (routine), no open issues, no evaluation. No testimonial potential (too generic/procedural).\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVfKpFXuFJRcXAhViLum\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":4541,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":4541,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":10,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVfKoiXc7UU1gNc7HLcC\",\"session_id\":\"35210d59-d479-4201-874c-977170769ab0\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-28T10:15:14.677Z\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"4c3db137-27f3-4ca6-8dc8-0a7c680c3fc7\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"},\"id\":\"toolu_01HwewYhccweFCGN6UavEgXv\",\"input\":{\"records\":[{\"follow_up_needed\":\"yes\",\"id\":\"DEV-031\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"yes\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"